@startuml 03-供应链端
' 民生甄选 · 系统用例图 L2 · 供应链端（UC-SYS-S01 ~ S11）
title 民生甄选 · 系统用例图 · 供应链端
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "供应商" as SUPPLIER
actor "采购方" as BUYER

rectangle "供应链端系统（功能边界）" {
  usecase "UC-SYS-S01 入驻供应商并核验资质" as S01
  usecase "UC-SYS-S02 上架商品并生成溯源" as S02
  usecase "UC-SYS-S03 浏览选品与查看详情" as S03
  usecase "UC-SYS-S04 辅助采购决策" as S04
  usecase "UC-SYS-S05 担保交易与货款托管" as S05
  usecase "UC-SYS-S06 验收到货与拒收退款" as S06
  usecase "UC-SYS-S07 互评交易并联动信用" as S07
  usecase "UC-SYS-S08 投诉假货并闭环" as S08
  usecase "UC-SYS-S09 扫码验真溯源" as S09
  usecase "UC-SYS-S10 管理供应商信用与申诉" as S10
  usecase "UC-SYS-S11 仲裁交易争议" as S11
}

SUPPLIER --> S01
SUPPLIER --> S02
SUPPLIER --> S05
SUPPLIER --> S07
SUPPLIER --> S10
SUPPLIER --> S11
BUYER --> S03
BUYER --> S04
BUYER --> S05
BUYER --> S06
BUYER --> S07
BUYER --> S08
BUYER --> S09
BUYER --> S11

S11 ..> S06 : <<extend>>
note right of S11
  验收分歧时延伸争议仲裁（32 T-15「验收争议进入存证仲裁」）
end note
note bottom of S05
  担保交易 include 分账结算（UC-SUB-I-04），平台运营方提供结算通道（次要参与者）
end note
@enduml
